  ("No Slack workspace yet.\nSign in to one with the token and cookie\nSlack's web app signs in with, which How to Sign In finds." . "还没有 Slack 工作区。\n请使用 Slack 网页版登录时所用的令牌和 cookie\n登录一个工作区；“如何登录”说明了如何找到它们。")
  ("Sign in again" . "重新登录")
  ("Add a workspace" . "添加工作区")
  ("How to sign in" . "如何登录")
  ("Sign out" . "退出登录")
  ("Slack lets emacs-slack in with the token and the cookie its web app signs in with.  To find them, sign in to your workspace in Chrome or Firefox, then:\n\n1.  Open my.slack.com/customize, with Open Slack's Page below.\n\n2.  Open the browser's developer tools, Inspect in the page's context menu, and their Console.  There type\n\n        window.prompt(\"Token\", TS.boot_data.api_token)\n\n    and copy the token it shows, which starts with xoxc-.\n\n3.  In the developer tools' Application tab (Storage in Firefox), under Cookies, find the cookie named d and copy its value as it is shown, not decoded.  Copy the cookies d-s and lc too, and put them together as\n\n        xoxd-…; d-s=…; lc=…\n\n4.  Press Add Workspace…, then give the workspace's name, as in NAME.slack.com, your email there, the token and the cookie.\n\nThey are kept with auth-source, in the first of your auth-sources (~/.authinfo, unless you said another); auth-source asks before it writes there.  Anyone who reads them can read and write in Slack as you: keep them in an encrypted ~/.authinfo.gpg, or in the macOS Keychain." . "Slack 允许 emacs-slack 使用其网页版登录时所用的令牌和 cookie 登录。要找到它们，请先在 Chrome 或 Firefox 中登录你的工作区，然后：\n\n1.  用下方的“打开 Slack 页面”打开 my.slack.com/customize。\n\n2.  打开浏览器的开发者工具（页面右键菜单中的“检查”），再打开其中的“控制台”。在那里输入\n\n        window.prompt(\"Token\", TS.boot_data.api_token)\n\n    然后拷贝它显示的令牌，该令牌以 xoxc- 开头。\n\n3.  在开发者工具的“应用”标签页（Firefox 中为“存储”）中，在 Cookie 下找到名为 d 的 cookie，按显示的原样拷贝其值，不要解码。同样拷贝 cookie d-s 和 lc，并按以下格式拼在一起：\n\n        xoxd-…; d-s=…; lc=…\n\n4.  按下“添加工作区…”，然后输入工作区名称（即 NAME.slack.com 中的 NAME）、你在该工作区的电子邮件、令牌和 cookie。\n\n它们通过 auth-source 保存在你的第一个 auth-source 中（默认为 ~/.authinfo，除非你另有指定）；auth-source 写入前会先询问你。任何读到它们的人都能以你的身份在 Slack 中读写：请将它们保存在加密的 ~/.authinfo.gpg 中，或保存在 macOS 钥匙串中。")
  ("Open Slack's Page" . "打开 Slack 页面")
  ("Attach a file" . "附加文件")
  ("Thread" . "消息列")
  ("React…" . "回应…")
  ("Attach…" . "附加…")
