  ("Copied: %s" . "已拷贝：%s")
  ("Nothing to install here" . "这里没有要安装的内容")
  ("Telega still needs TDLib" . "Telega 仍需要 TDLib")
  ("Telega still needs TDLib %s or later" . "Telega 仍需要 TDLib %s 或更高版本")
  ("Telega still needs a C compiler" . "Telega 仍需要 C 编译器")
  ("Telega still needs telega-server built" . "Telega 仍需要构建 telega-server")
  ("Telega talks to Telegram through TDLib, Telegram's library,\nof version %s or later, which Homebrew installs:\n\n%s\n\nIt builds it from its latest sources, which takes a while." . "Telega 通过 Telegram 的库 TDLib 与 Telegram 通信，\n需要 %s 或更高版本，可用 Homebrew 安装：\n\n%s\n\nHomebrew 会从最新源代码构建它，需要一段时间。")
  ("The TDLib installed, %s, is older than the %s Telega needs.\nInstall its latest sources over it, in Terminal:\n\n%s\n\nThen check again." . "已安装的 TDLib %s 比 Telega 需要的 %s 旧。\n请在终端中用最新源代码覆盖安装：\n\n%s\n\n然后再次检查。")
  ("Telega builds telega-server, its program talking to Telegram,\nwith a C compiler, which Apple's command line tools install:\n\n%s" . "Telega 用 C 编译器构建 telega-server，即它与 Telegram 通信的程序，\n安装 Apple 的命令行工具即可获得 C 编译器：\n\n%s")
  ("TDLib is installed.  Telega now builds telega-server,\nits program talking to Telegram, once: it takes a minute.\nThen it signs in with your phone number." . "TDLib 已安装。Telega 现在要构建一次 telega-server，\n即它与 Telegram 通信的程序：这需要一分钟左右。\n然后它会用你的电话号码登录。")
