  ("Home" . "个人")
  ("LispM is a desktop for coding agents, made of Emacs.  This guide shows it to you a part at a time, and circles each part in red as it speaks of it." . "LispM 是一个为编程智能体打造、由 Emacs 构成的桌面。本指南会一次介绍它的一个部分，讲到哪个部分就用红圈将其圈出。")
  ("the next step" . "下一步")
  ("the step before" . "上一步")
  ("puts the guide away" . "收起指南")
  ("brings it back, from anywhere" . "在任何地方重新打开指南")
  ("The λ menu" . "λ 菜单")
  ("LispM's own menu, at the left end of the menu bar, as the Apple menu was: a new agent session, a shell, the App Store and the control panels." . "LispM 自己的菜单，像当年的苹果菜单一样位于菜单栏左端：其中有新的智能体会话、Shell、App Store 和控制面板。")
  ("opens the menu bar from the keyboard; C-f and C-b go to the menu beside" . "用键盘打开菜单栏；C-f 和 C-b 前往旁边的菜单")
  ("The application in front" . "最前面的应用程序")
  ("The menus after the λ are those of the application in front, this guide's now: File and Go.  The Application menu, at the right end, names it and lists the others, to bring one forward." . "λ 之后的菜单属于最前面的应用程序，现在是本指南的菜单：“文件”和“前往”。右端的应用程序菜单显示它的名称并列出其他应用程序，可将其中一个调到前面。")
  ("brings the next application forward" . "将下一个应用程序调到前面")
  ("The desktop's icons" . "桌面图标")
  ("They stand down the right edge.  A click selects one, a double click opens it, and one dragged stays where it is dropped.  Home is your home folder, in a Finder window." . "它们沿右边缘排列。点按可选择图标，连按两次可打开，拖移的图标会停留在放下的位置。“个人”是你的个人文件夹，在 Finder 窗口中打开。")
  ("select the next icon or the one before, while the desktop has the keyboard" . "在桌面接收键盘输入时，选择下一个或上一个图标")
  ("opens the icon selected" . "打开所选图标")
  ("Where the work is done: a workspace for each project, with its files, its terminals and its agents, and a sidebar listing them.  It fills the screen, or floats over the desktop as Show Me opens it; its zoom box switches." . "工作的地方：每个项目一个工作区，包含项目的文件、终端和智能体，还有一个列出它们的边栏。它可以占满屏幕，也可以像“演示给我看”打开它时那样浮在桌面上；用它的缩放框切换。")
  ("starts a LispM agent in the project" . "在项目中启动 LispM 智能体")
  ("shows the agents" . "显示智能体")
  ("opens a terminal" . "打开终端")
  ("The browser" . "浏览器")
  ("The web, dressed as Netscape Communicator: tabs, bookmarks and history, and pages followed from the keyboard." . "以 Netscape Communicator 的样子浏览网页：有标签页、书签和历史记录，还能用键盘跟随页面上的链接。")
  ("goes to the location field" . "前往位置栏")
  ("opens a new tab" . "打开新标签页")
  ("labels a page's links, to follow the one typed" . "为页面上的链接加标签，输入标签即可跟随该链接")
  ("The App Store" . "App Store")
  ("Applications and extensions to install: games, news, music and more agents.  The applications installed are in the Applications folder." . "可安装的应用程序和扩展：游戏、新闻、音乐以及更多智能体。已安装的应用程序位于“应用程序”文件夹中。")
  ("searches the App Store" . "搜索 App Store")
  ("opens the selected item's page, DEL goes back" . "打开所选项目的页面，DEL 返回")
  ("The Control Strip" . "控制条")
  ("Settings at hand, in the corner: the appearance, the desktop's picture, the keyboard and the Internet.  The Control Panels icon holds every setting." . "角落里的常用设置：外观、桌面图片、键盘和互联网。“控制面板”图标包含所有设置。")
  ("goes to the strip: C-f and C-b to a module, RET opens it" . "前往控制条：用 C-f 和 C-b 切换模块，RET 打开")
  ("hides the strip, or shows it again" . "隐藏或重新显示控制条")
  ("Windows" . "窗口")
  ("This window is like every other: its title bar drags it, the box at the left closes it, the one at the right rolls it up into its title bar, and the corner at the bottom right sizes it.  A zoom box, where there is one, fills the screen with the window." . "这个窗口和其他窗口一样：拖移标题栏可移动窗口，左边的框可关闭窗口，右边的框可将窗口卷起到标题栏中，右下角可调整窗口大小。如果有缩放框，它可让窗口占满屏幕。")
  ("hides the desktop in the Dock, its windows out on your screen" . "将桌面隐藏到程序坞中，其窗口则留在你的屏幕上")
  ("Emacs, as ever" . "Emacs，一如既往")
  ("Emacs's own keys work everywhere, as they always did.  This guide is an application of its own: it waits in the Applications folder, the λ menu and the desktop's Help menu whenever you want it again." . "Emacs 自己的按键在任何地方都和以往一样有效。本指南是一个独立的应用程序：想再次查看时，可在“应用程序”文件夹、λ 菜单和桌面的“帮助”菜单中找到它。")
  ("opens a file" . "打开文件")
  ("switches to a buffer" . "切换到缓冲区")
  ("runs any command" . "运行任意命令")
  ("cancels" . "取消")
